<h1 id="annexure-b-role-based-access-control-rbac-matrix">ANNEXURE B: ROLE-BASED ACCESS CONTROL (RBAC) MATRIX</h1>
<p><strong>System Name:</strong> Educational Institution Gate Monitoring &amp; Access Control System<br>
<strong>Document Version:</strong> 1.0.0<br>
<strong>Date:</strong> August 17, 2026<br>
<strong>Classification:</strong> Confidential - Security Policy Reference</p>
<hr>
<h2 id="1-system-roles--hierarchical-definitions">1. System Roles &amp; Hierarchical Definitions</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
